# VentureOS — 9-Phase Lifecycle State Machine
# State transitions, gate criteria, outputs

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "01 IDENTIFY\nProblem validation,\ncustomer discovery" as P1
    state "02 IDEA\nHypothesis articulation,\nresearch plan" as P2
    state "03 VALIDATE\nPMF search, 40% Very Disappointed\ntest, retention curve" as P3: [[PMF GATE: ≥40% "Very Disappointed"]]
    state "04 ARCHITECT\nTechnical architecture,\nteam planning" as P4
    state "05 INCORPORATE\nLegal entity, cap table,\nfunding ready" as P5
    state "06 SEED\nMVP → beta launch,\nwedge market" as P6: [[SEED GATE: MVP shipped + 10+ active users]]
    state "07 BUILD\nRevenue, product-market fit\nextension" as P7: [[SCALE GATE: CAC payback <12mo, LTV/CAC > 3]]
    state "08 SCALE\nGTM at scale, new markets,\nSeries B+" as P8
    state "09 EXIT\nAcquisition, IPO,\nor ongoing business" as P9

    P1 --> P2: "Problem validated\n(50+ user confirmations)"
    P2 --> P3: "Research complete\n(pass: reasonable TAM)"
    P3 --> P4: "PMF achieved\n(40% Very Disappointed ⭐)"
    P3 --> P2: "No PMF → Iterate\n(max 3 cycles)"
    P4 --> P5: "Architecture approved\n(bypass: solo dev)"
    P5 --> P6: "Incorporated\n(founders %, ESOP, bank)"
    P6 --> P7: "Seed traction\n(10+ active users, weekly growth)"
    P7 --> P8: "Unit economics proven\n(CAC payback <12mo, 100%+ YoY)"
    P8 --> P9: "Market dominance or\nexit window opens"
    P9 --> P1: "Spinout new venture\n(bisync memory → memory/)"

    note right of P3
        ⭐ CORE GATE
        Sean Ellis test:
        "How would you feel if
        [product] disappeared?"
        ≥40% "Very Disappointed" = PMF
    end note

    note right of P8
        Rule of 40: Growth% + Margin% ≥ 40
        Market leader signal required
    end note

    note right of P9
        SEA: Regional exits
        (HOSE, IDX, SET)
        or US listing target
        or regional acquirer

        SV: Nasdaq IPO standard
    end note
